# LOTS (Lloyds Online Trade Services) - Client Side Functional Documentation

# 1. What is LOTS?

LOTS = Lloyds Online Trade Services.

A portal used by corporate customers to initiate and manage trade finance transactions online.

Think of it as:

```text
Customer

↓

LOTS Portal

↓

Lloyds Trade Finance Team

↓

Back-end systems (Finastra TI/FTI)
```

Customers no longer send paper forms.

They create transactions online.

---

# Main Products inside Trade Services

| Product                        | Purpose                           | Who uses it |
| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | ----------- |
| Import Letter of Credit (ILC)  | Buyer requests bank to pay seller | Importer    |
| Export Collection (EC)         | Seller asks bank to collect money | Exporter    |
| Import Collection (IC)         | Buyer receives documents and pays | Importer    |
| Undertaking Issuance (BG/SBLC) | Customer requests bank guarantee  | Applicant   |

---

