# 1. IMPORT LETTER OF CREDIT (ILC)

# Business Flow

```text
Buyer (Applicant)

↓

Lloyds Bank

↓

Seller (Beneficiary)
```

### Example

```text
India importer buys machinery from Germany.

Importer:

I want bank to guarantee payment.

Lloyds issues LC.

Seller ships goods.

Seller gets paid.
```

