# QA Lead Cheat Sheet

For every LOTS screen verify:

### UI

* Mandatory fields
* Field length
* Dropdown values
* Date validations

### Workflow

* Save draft
* Submit
* Approve
* Reject
* Cancel

### Business validations

* Applicant ≠ Beneficiary
* Expiry > Shipment date
* Amount > 0
* Mandatory documents uploaded

### Security

* Entity access
* Role access
* Maker-checker access

